OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy this evening but staying dry.
OL,7,FOvernight will also be dry and mostly
OL,8,Fcloudy but with some clearer spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Moderate southerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA dry morning with bright
OL,12,Fspells. It will turn cloudier in the
OL,13,Fafternoon with the odd spot of light
OL,14,Frain possible. Breezy southerly winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fwith patchy rain turning dry and
OL,18,Fbrighter later Saturday. Sunday will
OL,19,Fcontinue dry with sunny spells but
OL,20,Fcloud and further rain spreads east
OL,21,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
